      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Mosca-Abelha. Ribombee percebe quando pessoas ou Pokémon estão desanimados e os alegra com bolinhos de pólen feitos por ele. Os produzidos por indivíduos habilidosos aliviam o cansaço e são muito valorizados.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 7 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 5 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Inseto, Fada &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 2/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Ribombee é a evolução final de Cutiefly.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Absorb, Fairy Wind, Pollen Puff, Struggle Bug, Stun Spore</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Silver Wind</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Draining Kiss</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Sweet Scent</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Bug Buzz</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Covet</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Dazzling Gleam</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Aromatherapy, Switcheroo</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Quiver Dance</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Acrobatics, Aerial Ace, After You, Agility, Alluring Voice, Ally Switch, Attract, Baton Pass, Bug Bite, Bug Buzz, Calm Mind, Charm, Confide, Covet, Dazzling Gleam, Defog, Double Team, Draining Kiss, Dream Eater, Dual Wingbeat, Endure, Energy Ball, Facade, Fake Tears, Frustration, Giga Impact, Grass Knot, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Hyper Beam, Imprison, Infestation, Last Resort, Leech Life, Light Screen, Lunge, Magic Room, Magical Leaf, Nature Power, Play Rough, Pollen Puff, Pounce, Protect, Psych Up, Psychic, Psychic Noise, Reflect, Rest, Return, Roost, Round, Safeguard, Signal Beam, Skill Swap, Skitter Smack, Sleep Talk, Snore, Solar Beam, Speed Swap, Stored Power, Struggle Bug, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swift, Tailwind, Take Down, Telekinesis, Tera Blast, Thief, Toxic, Trailblaze, Trick, U-turn, Wonder Room</p>",
